this contain details about backend for later breif

structure 
    1- config {
        this contain all the database configuration files
    }
    2-models {
        store the model of mongodb database
    }
    3-middleware{
        store all middleware
    }
    4- controller{
        logic of our backend
    }
    5- routes
    6- uploads{
        upload all image uploaded by user
    }



all dependencies have their purpose  like

multer used to store image at upload